        <item>
            <title>2.20.2</title>
            <pubDate>Tue, 01 Sep 2026 00:17:12 +0900</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/Saqoosha/Canopy</link>
            <sparkle:version>98</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.20.2</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Changes

- The MacroPad's LEDs breathe more slowly — 2500 ms per cycle instead of 2000. The old period was about 30 breaths a minute, faster than a resting person breathes; the slower one is calmer to sit beside.
- A working session's key breathes deeper than before, so it reads as active rather than nearly static from the corner of your eye, and it separates from a background task by color alone.
- The shape of the breath itself lives in the MacroPad firmware, which now uses a curve with a narrow peak and a wide trough instead of a raw sine. Flash the latest firmware to get it; the slower period applies either way.
]]></description>
